
#----------------------------- Global Properties ----------------------------#

/outputDir:bin/$(Platform)/Content
/intermediateDir:obj/$(Platform)
/platform:Windows
/config:
/profile:HiDef
/compress:False

#-------------------------------- References --------------------------------#

#---------------------------------- Content ---------------------------------#

# Every effect the three executables load, compiled ONCE, here (#618). Prazsky.Shaders.csproj hands this file
# to MonoGame.Content.Builder.Task, and the compiled .xnb files become Content items of this library linked as
# Content/Shaders/<name>.xnb, so every executable that references the library gets them copied into its own
# output (and its publish folder) at the path it has always loaded them from: Load<Effect>("Shaders/Sky").
#
# The executables' own Content.mgcb files carry no shader entries. Until #618 each of them built these out of
# Testbed/Content/Shaders - one copy of each source but three compilations, and the shipping Game depending
# on the development instrument's content directory.
#
# Every effect is built for every referencer, including the ones an executable never loads (the MapEditor has
# no gun and no Sky.fx dome, so ShotTrail, Fireworks, Confetti, LaserGrid, Blast, Wormhole, MuzzleRays, MotionBlur and Sky sit
# unused beside it): a few hundred kilobytes of unused .xnb is the price of one list instead of three.
#
# /platform:Windows is DirectX 11, Shader Model 5.0. The content task passes /platform:$(MonoGamePlatform)
# after this file, which is why Prazsky.Shaders.csproj sets MonoGamePlatform to Windows itself - see there.
#
# The one shader here only the Game loads on purpose is Sky.fx: the MapEditor draws its dome through its own
# BasicEffect, so it gets no cloud deck and no sun disc (Sky.fx's own header, and "The storm" in
# docs/scenes.md).

#begin Shaders/InstancedModel.fx
/importer:EffectImporter
/processor:EffectProcessor
/processorParam:DebugMode=Auto
/build:Shaders/InstancedModel.fx

#begin Shaders/Glare.fx
/importer:EffectImporter
/processor:EffectProcessor
/processorParam:DebugMode=Auto
/build:Shaders/Glare.fx

